  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Conceptualizing \"KhananDrishti\"**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the overarching concept. I\'m calling it \"KhananDrishti\" or CoalGov AI. My goal is to create a centralized, AI-powered platform for smart governance and compliance monitoring within the Indian coal mining ecosystem. This requires a comprehensive architecture, and I\'m just starting to sketch out the high-level components.\n\n\n**Exploring Gemini API Capabilities**\n\nI\'m now diving into the specifics. I\'m checking the utility of `gemini-api`, seeing how it can empower features like automated risk scoring, compliance summary generation, and a conversational assistant for navigating mining regulations. The goal is a multi-tier dashboard to serve mine officials, subsidiary headquarters, and regulatory bodies.\n\n\n**Defining Key Performance Indicators**\n\nI\'ve been working on defining key performance indicators. The focus is now on developing a real-time statutory compliance health index, covering safety, environmental regulations, production planning, DGMS circulars, and labor laws. I\'m focusing on metrics like active mines, cumulative compliance scores, open violations, high-risk hazards, and environmental compliance, like production limits and ambient air quality. I\'m also including contractor worker compliance in my thought process.\n\n\n"
