  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Header**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the `src/components/Header.tsx` file. I\'m building out the top banner, thinking through the Indian Coal Ministry and Coal India Ltd branding integration. I\'m also considering the National Emblem/Coal icon motif, a live timestamp, and an offline/online sync status indicator.\n\n\n**Expanding the Functionality**\n\nI\'ve been expanding the header\'s features significantly, integrating a toggle, an Emergency Alert banner, and a Subsidiary filter for granular control. The header will now also house a Selected Mine switcher, a Multi-Tier Role Switcher, and a comprehensive navigation bar with distinct sections, each catering to different workflows: Command Hub, GIS Spatial Mine Map, Field Inspection, Statutory Registers, AI Sentinel, Contractor Portal, and Workflow & Audit.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 7
      nanos: 117895575
    }
