  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Developing Field Inspection Engine**\n\nI\'m now focusing on building the `src/components/FieldInspection.tsx` component. It\'s the core of the Geo-Tagged Mobile & Web Field Inspection Engine. I\'m prioritizing the simulation of live GPS locking, aiming for \302\2611.5m accuracy and real-time data. Also on the to-do list: implementing camera photo attachment and evidence capture, and then adding Inspection Type selection (DG).\n\n\n**Expanding Inspection Checklists**\n\nI\'ve significantly expanded the inspection checklists to cover various statutory audits and safety rounds. Specifically, I\'m integrating checks related to DGMS and Coal Mines Regulations 2017, encompassing both opencast and underground mining operations. The new modules include inspections for HEMM machinery fitness and environmental compliance, and are designed to function offline. Offline functionality includes local storage and seamless synchronization via SHA-256 signatures, alongside generating immediate inspection slips.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 12
      nanos: 33620679
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
