  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Statutory Registers**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `StatutoryRegisters.tsx` component. My initial work is on Form IV, specifically the Register of Accidents & Dangerous Occurrences as per CMR 2017 and the Mines Act of 1952. This is the first step in ensuring paperless statutory registers and legal compliance forms.\n\n\n**Expanding Statutory Registers**\n\nNow, I\'m integrating modules into the system. Form IX will be a digital record of inspections by DGMS, internal auditors, and SPCB. I\'m also building Form B, a detailed register of employees, including worker IDs, categories, due dates, certifications, and compliance metrics. Lastly, I\'m working on compliance reports for MoEFCC and the Ministry of Coal\'s Star Rating self-evaluation, which includes 50 key indicators.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 10
      nanos: 711744821
    }
