  planner_response {
    response: "I have designed and implemented **\340\244\226\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\244\250\340\244\246\340\245\203\340\244\267\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\277 (KhananDrishti)**, an AI-enabled centralized smart governance, statutory compliance, and safety monitoring platform tailored for the Indian coal mining ecosystem (Ministry of Coal, DGMS, Coal India Limited, and operating subsidiaries).\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities & Architecture\n\n- **Role-Based Command Hub**:\n  - Live KPI telemetry for Coal India subsidiaries (SECL, ECL, BCCL, CCL, MCL, NCL, WCL), tracking compliance scores, active DGMS violations, CAAQMS dust/water metrics, and Ministry of Coal 5-Star Ratings.\n  - Multi-tier role switching between **Colliery Mine Officials**, **Subsidiary & CIL HQ Management**, and **DGMS Regulatory Authorities**.\n\n- **Interactive GIS Spatial Mine Visualizer**:\n  - High-precision cadastral map with layer toggles for leasehold boundaries, 500m statutory blasting danger perimeters, haul road gradient validation (\342\211\244 1:16 standard), slope stability radar alerts, and geo-tagged hazard pins.\n  - Cross-section view modes for both mega Opencast quarry benches and Underground longwall panels.\n\n- **Offline-First Mobile & Web Field Inspection Engine**:\n  - High-precision GNSS GPS geo-tagging (\302\2611.5m accuracy), bench RL level altitude calculation, and photographic evidence capture.\n  - Digital observation checklist covering **Coal Mines Regulations, 2017 (CMR 2017)** and **Mines Rules, 1955**.\n  - Encrypted offline queue that stores inspection logs locally when operating deep inside pits or underground galleries, auto-syncing with SHA-256 digital signatures upon network restoration.\n\n- **Paperless Statutory Registers & Ministry Reporting**:\n  - **Form B**: Digital register of mine employees and contractor labour with biometric turnstile gate-pass enforcement, Aadhaar KYC, and Periodic Medical Examination (PME) expiration alerts.\n  - **Form IV & IX**: Digital registers of accidents, dangerous occurrences, near misses, and statutory inspection visit entries.\n  - **MoEFCC Environmental Clearance (EC)**: Half-yearly compliance tracking, green belt afforestation survival rates, and mine closure escrow records.\n  - **Ministry 5-Star Rating Self-Evaluation**: 50-parameter scoring matrix across 7 modules.\n\n- **AI Sentinel (Gemini AI Powered Legal & Hazard Suite)**:\n  - **Statutory Notice OCR & Digitizer**: Parses raw DGMS Section 22(3) notices, EC letters, and SPCB orders into actionable tasks assigned to colliery engineers.\n  - **Predictive Hazard & Risk Matrix**: Computes hazard vectors by correlating real-time slope radar, gas levels (CH4/CO), and contractor safety records.\n  - **Automated Action Taken Report (ATR) Generator**: Formats legally compliant ATR documents ready for regulatory submission.\n  - **Statutory Mining Copilot**: Interactive legal advisor trained on CMR 2017, Mines Act 1952, and DGMS circulars.\n\n- **Contractor Safety Portal & Gate-Pass Enforcement**:\n  - Contractor agency safety scorecards, heavy machinery AFDSS fitness certifications, and automatic RFID gate-pass revocation for uncertified workers.\n\n- **CAPA Escalation & Blockchain-Style Audit Trail**:\n  - 3-tier automatic statutory escalation timer (Level 1 Colliery \342\206\222 Level 2 Subsidiary HQ \342\206\222 Level 3 DGMS Red Alert).\n  - Immutable SHA-256 hash-chained audit log with Class-3 Digital Signature Certificate (DSC) sign-offs.\n\n---\n\n### Backend Overview & Integration Instructions\n\nThe backend is organized with Express and Vite middleware:\n\n1. **Server Architecture (`/server.ts`)**:\n   - `GET /api/health`: Healthcheck endpoint.\n   - `POST /api/ai/ocr-doc`: Parses statutory notices using Gemini into structured covenants, deadlines, and assigned tasks.\n   - `POST /api/ai/analyze-risk`: Evaluates pit telemetry, slope radar, and open violations to produce hazard scores.\n   - `POST /api/ai/generate-atr`: Drafts certified statutory Action Taken Reports.\n   - `POST /api/ai/chat-copilot`: Conversational assistant for Coal Mines Regulations (CMR 2017).\n\n2. **Environment Configuration**:\n   - Store your `GEMINI_API_KEY` in the workspace environment or `.env` file (`process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY`).\n\n3. **Running the Application**:\n   - Development: `npm run dev` (starts the Express server with Vite middleware on port 3000).\n   - Production Build: `npm run build` (bundles the frontend into `dist/` and backend into `dist/server.cjs`).\n   - Production Run: `npm start`."
    modified_response: "I have designed and implemented **\340\244\226\340\244\276\340\244\250\340\244\250\340\244\246\340\245\203\340\244\267\340\245\215\340\244\237\340\244\277 (KhananDrishti)**, an AI-enabled centralized smart governance, statutory compliance, and safety monitoring platform tailored for the Indian coal mining ecosystem (Ministry of Coal, DGMS, Coal India Limited, and operating subsidiaries).\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities & Architecture\n\n- **Role-Based Command Hub**:\n  - Live KPI telemetry for Coal India subsidiaries (SECL, ECL, BCCL, CCL, MCL, NCL, WCL), tracking compliance scores, active DGMS violations, CAAQMS dust/water metrics, and Ministry of Coal 5-Star Ratings.\n  - Multi-tier role switching between **Colliery Mine Officials**, **Subsidiary & CIL HQ Management**, and **DGMS Regulatory Authorities**.\n\n- **Interactive GIS Spatial Mine Visualizer**:\n  - High-precision cadastral map with layer toggles for leasehold boundaries, 500m statutory blasting danger perimeters, haul road gradient validation (\342\211\244 1:16 standard), slope stability radar alerts, and geo-tagged hazard pins.\n  - Cross-section view modes for both mega Opencast quarry benches and Underground longwall panels.\n\n- **Offline-First Mobile & Web Field Inspection Engine**:\n  - High-precision GNSS GPS geo-tagging (\302\2611.5m accuracy), bench RL level altitude calculation, and photographic evidence capture.\n  - Digital observation checklist covering **Coal Mines Regulations, 2017 (CMR 2017)** and **Mines Rules, 1955**.\n  - Encrypted offline queue that stores inspection logs locally when operating deep inside pits or underground galleries, auto-syncing with SHA-256 digital signatures upon network restoration.\n\n- **Paperless Statutory Registers & Ministry Reporting**:\n  - **Form B**: Digital register of mine employees and contractor labour with biometric turnstile gate-pass enforcement, Aadhaar KYC, and Periodic Medical Examination (PME) expiration alerts.\n  - **Form IV & IX**: Digital registers of accidents, dangerous occurrences, near misses, and statutory inspection visit entries.\n  - **MoEFCC Environmental Clearance (EC)**: Half-yearly compliance tracking, green belt afforestation survival rates, and mine closure escrow records.\n  - **Ministry 5-Star Rating Self-Evaluation**: 50-parameter scoring matrix across 7 modules.\n\n- **AI Sentinel (Gemini AI Powered Legal & Hazard Suite)**:\n  - **Statutory Notice OCR & Digitizer**: Parses raw DGMS Section 22(3) notices, EC letters, and SPCB orders into actionable tasks assigned to colliery engineers.\n  - **Predictive Hazard & Risk Matrix**: Computes hazard vectors by correlating real-time slope radar, gas levels (CH4/CO), and contractor safety records.\n  - **Automated Action Taken Report (ATR) Generator**: Formats legally compliant ATR documents ready for regulatory submission.\n  - **Statutory Mining Copilot**: Interactive legal advisor trained on CMR 2017, Mines Act 1952, and DGMS circulars.\n\n- **Contractor Safety Portal & Gate-Pass Enforcement**:\n  - Contractor agency safety scorecards, heavy machinery AFDSS fitness certifications, and automatic RFID gate-pass revocation for uncertified workers.\n\n- **CAPA Escalation & Blockchain-Style Audit Trail**:\n  - 3-tier automatic statutory escalation timer (Level 1 Colliery \342\206\222 Level 2 Subsidiary HQ \342\206\222 Level 3 DGMS Red Alert).\n  - Immutable SHA-256 hash-chained audit log with Class-3 Digital Signature Certificate (DSC) sign-offs.\n\n---\n\n### Backend Overview & Integration Instructions\n\nThe backend is organized with Express and Vite middleware:\n\n1. **Server Architecture (`/server.ts`)**:\n   - `GET /api/health`: Healthcheck endpoint.\n   - `POST /api/ai/ocr-doc`: Parses statutory notices using Gemini into structured covenants, deadlines, and assigned tasks.\n   - `POST /api/ai/analyze-risk`: Evaluates pit telemetry, slope radar, and open violations to produce hazard scores.\n   - `POST /api/ai/generate-atr`: Drafts certified statutory Action Taken Reports.\n   - `POST /api/ai/chat-copilot`: Conversational assistant for Coal Mines Regulations (CMR 2017).\n\n2. **Environment Configuration**:\n   - Store your `GEMINI_API_KEY` in the workspace environment or `.env` file (`process.env.GEMINI_API_KEY`).\n\n3. **Running the Application**:\n   - Development: `npm run dev` (starts the Express server with Vite middleware on port 3000).\n   - Production Build: `npm run build` (bundles the frontend into `dist/` and backend into `dist/server.cjs`).\n   - Production Run: `npm start`."
