    user_response: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#050505] text-[#ECECEC] font-sans overflow-hidden\'> <aside class=\'w-[240px] border-r border-[#222] flex flex-col\'> <div class=\'p-6 border-b border-[#222]\'> <h1 class=\'text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-bold text-[#888] uppercase\'>Coal India Ltd.</h1> <p class=\'text-xl font-serif italic mt-1\'>MineSmart</p> </div> <nav class=\'flex-1 py-4\'> <div class=\'px-6 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-[#555] uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\'>Operational Governance</div> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-[#111] border-l-2 border-[#FF4D00] text-white\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>Central Command</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-[#888] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>GIS Mapping</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-[#888] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>Statutory Compliance</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-[#888] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>AI Risk Analysis</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-[#888] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>Inspection Logs</span> </a> </nav> <div class=\'p-6 border-t border-[#222]\'> <div class=\'bg-[#111] p-4 rounded\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] uppercase tracking-tighter text-[#555] mb-1\'>Backend Status</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-green-500 flex items-center gap-2\'> <span class=\'w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-green-500\'></span> Synchronized </p> </div> </div> </aside> <main class=\'flex-1 flex flex-col\'> <header class=\'h-16 border-b border-[#222] flex items-center justify-between px-8 bg-[#080808]\'> <div class=\'flex gap-8\'> <div class=\'flex flex-col\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase text-[#555] tracking-widest\'>Active Mine Area</span> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>NCL-Singrauli-04</span> </div> <div class=\'flex flex-col border-l border-[#222] pl-8\'> <span class=\'text-[10px] uppercase text-[#555] tracking-widest\'>Safety Index</span> <span class=\'text-sm font-medium text-green-400\'>98.2 / Optimal</span> </div> </div> <div class=\'flex items-center gap-4\'> <div class=\'text-right\'> <p class=\'text-xs font-medium\'>Vikram Singh</p> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-[#555]\'>Area Manager, NCL</p> </div> <div class=\'w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-[#333] border border-[#444]\'></div> </div> </header> <section class=\'flex-1 grid grid-cols-12 grid-rows-12 gap-0\'> <div class=\'col-span-8 row-span-7 border-r border-b border-[#222] p-6 bg-[#090909] relative\'> <div class=\'absolute top-6 right-6 flex gap-2\'> <span class=\'px-2 py-1 bg-[#1A1A1A] text-[10px] rounded uppercase\'>Spatial Data v4.1</span> <span class=\'px-2 py-1 bg-[#FF4D00]/20 text-[#FF4D00] text-[10px] rounded uppercase\'>2 Critical Zones</span> </div> <h2 class=\'font-serif italic text-3xl mb-4\'>Geospatial Monitoring</h2> <div class=\'w-full h-[320px] bg-[#111] rounded-lg border border-[#222] flex items-center justify-center relative overflow-hidden\'> <div class=\'absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(#333_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px]\'></div> <div class=\'relative text-center\'> <div class=\'w-24 h-24 border border-[#333] rounded-full mx-auto flex items-center justify-center mb-4\'> <div class=\'w-16 h-16 border border-[#FF4D00] border-dashed rounded-full animate-pulse\'></div> </div> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#555] uppercase tracking-widest\'>GIS Engine Active: Monitoring Sector 4A-4D</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'col-span-4 row-span-7 border-b border-[#222] p-6 flex flex-col\'> <h2 class=\'font-serif italic text-2xl mb-6\'>AI Risk Engine</h2> <div class=\'space-y-4 flex-1\'> <div class=\'p-4 bg-[#111] border-l-2 border-red-500\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-red-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\'>Violation Alert</p> <p class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>CMR 2017: Ventilation Drift Gap</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#666] mt-1\'>Subsidiary: MCL | Sector: D-12</p> </div> <div class=\'p-4 bg-[#111] border-l-2 border-orange-500\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-orange-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\'>Predictive Warning</p> <p class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Methane Fluctuation Detected</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#666] mt-1\'>Drill Site #14 | Accuracy: 94.2%</p> </div> <div class=\'p-4 bg-[#111] border-l-2 border-blue-500\'> <p class=\'text-[10px] text-blue-500 uppercase font-bold mb-1\'>Efficiency Insight</p> <p class=\'text-sm font-medium\'>Production Lag in Night Shift</p> <p class=\'text-xs text-[#666] mt-1\'>Excavation Unit: OB-04</p> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\'col-span-12 row-span-5 p-6\'> <div class=\'flex items-center justify-between mb-4\'> <h2 class=\'font-serif italic text-2xl\'>Statutory Compliance Tracking</h2> <div class=\'flex gap-4\'> <button class=\'text-[10px] uppercase border border-[#333] px-3 py-1 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\'>Export Report</button> <button class=\'text-[10px] uppercase border border-[#333] px-3 py-1 hover:bg-white hover:text-black transition-all\'>OCR Digitizer</button> </div> </div> <table class=\'w-full text-left border-collapse\'> <thead> <tr class=\'border-b border-[#222] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-[#555]\'> <th class=\'pb-3\'>Regulation ID</th> <th class=\'pb-3\'>Requirement</th> <th class=\'pb-3\'>Due Date</th> <th class=\'pb-3\'>Field Officer</th> <th class=\'pb-3 text-right\'>Status</th> </tr> </thead> <tbody class=\'text-sm\'> <tr class=\'border-b border-[#111]\'> <td class=\'py-3 font-mono text-xs\'>CMR-104-B</td> <td class=\'py-3\'>Surface Dust Suppression (Quarterly)</td> <td class=\'py-3 text-[#888]\'>12 Oct 2023</td> <td class=\'py-3\'>R. Murali</td> <td class=\'py-3 text-right text-green-500\'>Completed</td> </tr> <tr class=\'border-b border-[#111]\'> <td class=\'py-3 font-mono text-xs\'>EPR-2021-S4</td> <td class=\'py-3\'>Effluent Quality Discharge Audit</td> <td class=\'py-3 text-[#888]\'>28 Oct 2023</td> <td class=\'py-3\'>S. Chatterjee</td> <td class=\'py-3 text-right text-orange-400\'>Pending</td> </tr> <tr class=\'border-b border-[#111]\'> <td class=\'py-3 font-mono text-xs\'>SFT-MM-09</td> <td class=\'py-3\'>Blasting Master License Renewal</td> <td class=\'py-3 text-[#888]\'>05 Nov 2023</td> <td class=\'py-3\'>K. Venkat</td> <td class=\'py-3 text-right text-blue-400\'>In Review</td> </tr> </tbody> </table> </div> </section> <footer class=\'h-8 bg-[#0A0A0A] border-t border-[#222] flex items-center px-8 justify-between\'> <p class=\'text-[9px] text-[#444] uppercase tracking-[0.2em]\'>Integrated Smart Governance Framework \342\200\242 Ver 2.0.4</p> <p class=\'text-[9px] text-[#444]\'>DEV ADVISORY: NODE.JS/EXPRESS BACKEND + POSTGIS SPATIAL DATABASE REQUIRED</p> </footer> </main> </div>\\n  </body>\\n</html>\nDesign instructions: Extract ONLY the styling (colors, fonts, spacing, borders, shadows, backgrounds, gradients) and layout patterns (flexbox/grid structure, component arrangement) from the Design HTML above. Do NOT replace or restructure the existing app\'s HTML elements \342\200\224 preserve all existing components, content, and functionality. Only modify CSS/styling and adjust layout containers as needed to match the theme\'s aesthetic. You MUST execute file editing or creation tool calls (such as edit_file, multi_edit_file, or create_file) to apply styling updates to target files directly. Do NOT output code blocks, HTML, or TSX directly in your text chat response.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_END]"
    items {
      text: "Apply the \"Editorial Aesthetic\" design theme to the app.\n[AIS_METADATA_SECTION_START]\nDesign name: Editorial Aesthetic\nDesign HTML: <!doctype html>\\n<html style=\\\"height: 100%; margin: 0;\\\">\\n  <head>\\n    <meta charset=\\\"UTF-8\\\" />\\n    <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\\\" />\\n    <script src=\\\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@tailwindcss/browser@4\\\"></script>\\n    <link href=\\\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:opsz,wght,FILL,GRAD@20..48,100..700,0..1,-50..200\\\" rel=\\\"stylesheet\\\" />\\n    <style>\\n      body { margin: 0; height: 100%; display: flex; flex-direction: column; overflow: hidden; }\\n      /* Fallback classes in case Tailwind fails to load in sandbox */\\n      .h-full { height: 100%; }\\n      .w-full { width: 100%; }\\n      .flex { display: flex; }\\n      .flex-col { flex-direction: column; }\\n      .flex-1 { flex: 1 1 0%; }\\n    </style>\\n  </head>\\n  <body>\\n    <div class=\'flex h-[768px] w-[1024px] bg-[#050505] text-[#ECECEC] font-sans overflow-hidden\'> <aside class=\'w-[240px] border-r border-[#222] flex flex-col\'> <div class=\'p-6 border-b border-[#222]\'> <h1 class=\'text-xs tracking-[0.3em] font-bold text-[#888] uppercase\'>Coal India Ltd.</h1> <p class=\'text-xl font-serif italic mt-1\'>MineSmart</p> </div> <nav class=\'flex-1 py-4\'> <div class=\'px-6 py-2 text-xs font-bold text-[#555] uppercase tracking-widest mb-4\'>Operational Governance</div> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-[#111] border-l-2 border-[#FF4D00] text-white\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>Central Command</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-[#888] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>GIS Mapping</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=\'flex items-center px-6 py-3 text-[#888] hover:bg-[#111] transition-colors\'> <span class=\'text-sm\'>Statutory Compliance</span> </a> <a href=\'#\' class=