  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Implementing Editorial Aesthetic**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into `App.tsx` and the components, aiming for the Editorial Aesthetic theme application. I\'ve started with `Header.tsx`, focusing on those high-contrast black color combinations to establish the right mood. The specific shades for backgrounds and text are locked in, and will create good separation from other elements.\n\n\n**Refining Header Implementation**\n\nI\'ve just added several refinements to the `Header.tsx` implementation. I\'ve introduced a top banner with a tracked uppercase label and a serif italic branding, as well as editorial navigation with an active border accent in `#FF4D00`.  I\'ve created a minimalist role switcher and colliery selectors framed by sharp `#222` borders. Finally, I incorporated a backend synchronization status pill.\n\n\n"
