y fleet and civil contractors reallocated.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n\n          {/* Level 3 */}\n          <div className=\"bg-[#141414] p-4 rounded-lg border border-[#222] relative\">\n            <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n              <span className=\"text-[11px] font-mono font-bold text-red-400 uppercase tracking-wider\">\n                Level 3: Regulatory Red Alert\n              </span>\n              <span className=\"text-[10px] bg-[#070707] text-red-300 px-2 py-0.5 rounded font-mono border border-red-900/40\">\n                &gt; 14 Days Overdue\n              </span>\n            </div>\n            <p className=\"text-neutral-100 font-serif font-medium mt-2\">DGMS Regional Office & Ministry of Coal</p>\n            <p className=\"text-neutral-400 font-sans text-[11px] mt-1 leading-relaxed\">\n              Statutory prohibition notices, Star Rating penalty deduction, and physical joint re-inspection.\n            </p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      {/* Audit Log Chain & Digital Signature Box */}\n      <div className=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n        {/* Left 2 Cols: Immutable Audit Log List */}\n        <div className=\"lg:col-span-2 bg-[#0e0e0e] border border-[#222] rounded-xl p-5 shadow-lg space-y-4\">\n          <div className=\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-[#222]\">\n            <h3 className=\"text-sm font-serif font-semibold text-white flex items-center gap-2\">\n              <Lock className=\"w-4 h-4 text-[#FF4D00]\" />\n              <span>Immutable Hash-Chained Audit Stream</span>\n            </h3>\n            <span className=\"text-xs font-mono text-neutral-400\">{logs.length} Blocks</span>\n          </div>\n\n          <div className=\"space-y-3\">\n            {logs.map((log) => {\n              const isSelected = selectedLog?.id === log.id;\n              return (\n                <div\n                  key={log.id}\n     