  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the Login Page**\n\nI\'m starting the build of the `src/components/LoginPage.tsx` component. The key focus right now is on thoroughness, realism, and intuitive design. First, I\'m setting the design theme to the Editorial Dark aesthetic with a base color of `#050505`. I need to ensure a consistent look and feel across the application and that the Login page is up to the standard of the application\'s current design.\n\n\n**Defining Login Design**\n\nI\'ve fleshed out the styling specifics, moving beyond the base color. I\'m introducing a dark theme with a range of shades: `#0E0E0E`, `#141414`, and `#222`, plus an accent color `#FF4D00`. Heading styles will use Newsreader/Playfair, and Plus Jakarta Sans will be used for body text. JetBrains Mono is planned for numbers and codes. I\'m focusing on incorporating key capabilities, like a masthead with official emblems and a statutory banner. Also, I\'m designing two authentication modes: a quick persona switcher and a statutory credentials form, with pre-configured personas and standard credential input fields.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
