  planner_response {
    response: "The **Role-Based Statutory Login Gateway** is built and integrated into the application:\n\n### Where to Find & Access the Login Page\n\n1. **Direct Access / Logout**:\n   - In the top header bar, click on the **User Profile Badge** in the upper-right corner.\n   - Click **\"Log Out to Statutory Login Gateway\"** to immediately open the full-screen, dedicated Login Page.\n   - You can also switch active personas on the fly from the same user menu dropdown.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities of the Role-Based Login Page\n\n- **5 Mining Governance Personas & Roles**:\n  1. **Colliery Mines Manager** (*Er. Alok Kumar Sharma, 1st Class FMC* \342\200\223 SECL Gevra OCP): Full operational control, Form-B statutory authorization, and Class-3 DSC sign-off.\n  2. **Corporate HQ / Director Technical** (*Shri V. K. Mukherjee* \342\200\223 Coal India Apex, Kolkata): Pan-India 8-subsidiary governance, Ministry Star-Rating matrices, and Capex / Escrow allocations.\n  3. **DGMS Statutory Regulatory Inspector** (*Er. S. Bhattacharya, DDMS* \342\200\223 South Eastern Zone): Mines Act 1952 Section 22/22A prohibition powers, surprise audit logs, and compliance notices.\n  4. **Colliery Safety Officer & Lead Auditor** (*Er. Rajesh Verma* \342\200\223 ISO-45001 Auditor): Daily bench hazard logging, offline mobile sync, and gas/telemetry monitoring.\n  5. **Authorized Contractor Principal** (*Shri Sunil Singhal* \342\200\223 M/s Singhal Mining Logistics): Form-B contractor labour upload, PME medical certificates, and VTC training rosters.\n\n- **Authentication Modes**:\n  - **1-Click Quick Preset**: Click any mining persona card to inspect their statutory authority powers under Mines Act 1952 / CMR 2017 and sign in immediately.\n  - **Official Credentials Form**: Role dropdown, Subsidiary selector (SECL, ECL, BCCL, CCL, NCL, MCL, WCL, CIL HQ), Employee EIS number, passphrase, **Class-3 Cryptographic USB/DSC Token** simulation, and a security captcha.\n\n- **Role-Aware Landing**:\n  - Automatically redirects each role to their designated starting tab (e.g., Safety Officers land on **Field Inspection**, Contractors land on **Contractor & Form-B**, and Mine Managers land on the **Central Command Hub**)."
    modified_response: "The **Role-Based Statutory Login Gateway** is built and integrated into the application:\n\n### Where to Find & Access the Login Page\n\n1. **Direct Access / Logout**:\n   - In the top header bar, click on the **User Profile Badge** in the upper-right corner.\n   - Click **\"Log Out to Statutory Login Gateway\"** to immediately open the full-screen, dedicated Login Page.\n   - You can also switch active personas on the fly from the same user menu dropdown.\n\n---\n\n### Key Capabilities of the Role-Based Login Page\n\n- **5 Mining Governance Personas & Roles**:\n  1. **Colliery Mines Manager** (*Er. Alok Kumar Sharma, 1st Class FMC* \342\200\223 SECL Gevra OCP): Full operational control, Form-B statutory authorization, and Class-3 DSC sign-off.\n  2. **Corporate HQ / Director Technical** (*Shri V. K. Mukherjee* \342\200\223 Coal India Apex, Kolkata): Pan-India 8-subsidiary governance, Ministry Star-Rating matrices, and Capex / Escrow allocations.\n  3. **DGMS Statutory Regulatory Inspector** (*Er. S. Bhattacharya, DDMS* \342\200\223 South Eastern Zone): Mines Act 1952 Section 22/22A prohibition powers, surprise audit logs, and compliance notices.\n  4. **Colliery Safety Officer & Lead Auditor** (*Er. Rajesh Verma* \342\200\223 ISO-45001 Auditor): Daily bench hazard logging, offline mobile sync, and gas/telemetry monitoring.\n  5. **Authorized Contractor Principal** (*Shri Sunil Singhal* \342\200\223 M/s Singhal Mining Logistics): Form-B contractor labour upload, PME medical certificates, and VTC training rosters.\n\n- **Authentication Modes**:\n  - **1-Click Quick Preset**: Click any mining persona card to inspect their statutory authority powers under Mines Act 1952 / CMR 2017 and sign in immediately.\n  - **Official Credentials Form**: Role dropdown, Subsidiary selector (SECL, ECL, BCCL, CCL, NCL, MCL, WCL, CIL HQ), Employee EIS number, passphrase, **Class-3 Cryptographic USB/DSC Token** simulation, and a security captcha.\n\n- **Role-Aware Landing**:\n  - Automatically redirects each role to their designated starting tab (e.g., Safety Officers land on **Field Inspection**, Contractors land on **Contractor & Form-B**, and Mine Managers land on the **Central Command Hub**)."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
